</svg></div>
<h4 class="tve-toggle-text" data-css="tve-u-196f23383ba" style="">Can you fully recover from depression?</h4>
</div>
<div class="tve_faqC"><div class="thrv_wrapper thrv_toggle_content tve-elem-default-pad" data-css="tve-u-196f23383bb">
<div class="tve-content-box-background" data-css="tve-u-196f23383bc" style=""></div>
<div class="tve-cb" data-css="tve-u-196f23383bd"><div class="thrv_wrapper thrv_text_element" data-css="tve-u-196f23383be" style=""><p data-css="tve-u-196f23383bf" style="font-size: 16px !important;">Yes, many people fully recover from depression with the right combination of therapy, medication, lifestyle changes, and support. Recovery doesn’t mean you’ll never feel sad again—it means regaining control of your life, emotions, and functionality. Early intervention and consistent care significantly improve long-term outcomes.</p></div></div>
</div></div>
</div>
</div><div class="thrv_toggle_item tve_faq">
<div class="tve_faqI">
<div class="tve_faqB thrv_toggle_title tve-toggle-show-icon tcb-icon-display" data-append-suffix="1" data-css="tve-u-196f23383b9" data-icon-code="icon-angle-double-right-light" data-selector='[data-css="tve-u-196f23383b1"] .thrv_toggle_title' data-tcb_hover_state_parent="" style="">
