<h4 class="tve-toggle-text" data-css="tve-u-196f23383ba" style="">Is mental health treatment at Options PA confidential?</h4>
</div>
<div class="tve_faqC"><div class="thrv_wrapper thrv_toggle_content tve-elem-default-pad" data-css="tve-u-196f23383bb">
<div class="tve-content-box-background" data-css="tve-u-196f23383bc" style=""></div>
<div class="tve-cb" data-css="tve-u-196f23383bd"><div class="thrv_wrapper thrv_text_element" data-css="tve-u-196f23383be" style=""><p data-css="tve-u-196f23383bf" style="font-size: 16px !important;"><span>Absolutely. Your privacy is our priority. All consultations and treatments are strictly confidential and handled with the utmost care.</span><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;"></span></p></div></div>
</div></div>
</div>
</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="tcb-flex-col" data-css="tve-u-1977d225c4f" style=""><div class="tcb-col"><div class="thrv_wrapper thrv_toggle tve-toggle-auto-collapse tcb-local-vars-root" data-animation="slide-fade" data-animation-speed="medium" data-columns="1" data-css="tve-u-196f23383c7" data-ct="toggle-55876" data-ct-name="Toggle 04" data-element-name="Toggle" style=""><div class="thrive-colors-palette-config" style="display: none !important"></div><div class="thrive-group-edit-config" style="display: none !important"></div>
