<h4 class="tve-toggle-text" data-css="tve-u-196f23383c9" style="">How do you know if you're depressed?</h4>
</div>
<div class="tve_faqC"><div class="thrv_wrapper thrv_toggle_content tve-elem-default-pad" data-css="tve-u-196f23383ca" style="">
<div class="tve-content-box-background" data-css="tve-u-196f23383cb" style=""></div>
<div class="tve-cb" data-css="tve-u-196f23383cc"><div class="thrv_wrapper thrv_text_element" data-css="tve-u-196f23383cd"><p data-css="tve-u-196f23383ce">Signs of depression include persistent sadness, loss of interest in activities, fatigue, sleep disturbances, appetite changes, difficulty concentrating, and feelings of hopelessness. If these symptoms last longer than two weeks and interfere with daily life, it may be time to seek professional help, such as depression treatment in reading.</p></div></div>
</div></div>
</div>
</div><div class="thrv_toggle_item tve_faq">
<div class="tve_faqI">
<div class="tve_faqB thrv_toggle_title tve-toggle-show-icon tcb-icon-display" data-append-suffix="1" data-css="tve-u-196f23383c8" data-icon-code="icon-angle-double-right-light" data-selector='[data-css="tve-u-196f23383c7"] .thrv_toggle_title' data-tcb_hover_state_parent="" style="">
